LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert  
LUT cell release_pipe[2]_i_1, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) reset_count_reg[9]/CLR, reset_count_reg[8]/CLR, reset_count_reg[7]/CLR,
reset_count_reg[6]/CLR, reset_count_reg[5]/CLR, reset_count_reg[4]/CLR,
reset_count_reg[3]/CLR, reset_count_reg[2]/CLR, reset_count_reg[1]/CLR,
reset_count_reg[10]/CLR, reset_count_reg[0]/CLR, release_pipe_reg[2]/CLR,
release_pipe_reg[1]/CLR, release_pipe_reg[0]/CLR. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
